{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-counterfeit-dyson-supersonic-hairdryer-2511-0314","content_id":"54a0c4d9-f202-47e9-a8d3-782e05de99ab","description":"Product Safety Report for Counterfeit Dyson Supersonic Hairdryer presenting a high risk of electric shock and fire.","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"cccbcbb6-2d38-4e64-89ff-faa9da1f2520","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2025-12-23T10:38:56+00:00","id":"cccbcbb6-2d38-4e64-89ff-faa9da1f2520","title":"Link to product image and PDF","updated_at":"2025-12-23T10:38:56+00:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/694a71403022cdf03a0eb8cf/2511-0314-product-safety-report-counterfeit-dyson-supersonic.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: Counterfeit Dyson Supersonic Hairdryer</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The product presents a high risk of electric shock as the plug does not meet the dimensional requirements of BS 1363 and may not make a secure connection with the socket. Additionally, the plug fuse does not confirm to the requirements of BS 1362.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The import has been rejected at the border.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Electrical appliances and equipment – Hair-Styling (Powered)</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Barcode</td>\n      <td>5025155063705</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Serial number</td>\n      <td>R5K-UK-RHJ0846K</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>China</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>Supersonic hair dryer in grey with gold markings. Product claims to be ‘Dyson’ branded but has been confirmed as counterfeit. Consumers are advised to check the warning label on their product – the counterfeit has a misspelled safety warning as pictured.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_cccbcbb6-2d38-4e64-89ff-faa9da1f2520\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/694a71403022cdf03a0eb8cf/2511-0314-product-safety-report-counterfeit-dyson-supersonic.pdf\">Link to product image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The product presents a high risk of electric shock as the plug does not meet the dimensional requirements of BS 1363 and may not make a secure connection with the socket. This could lead to the user accidentally touching a live part during use and receiving an electric shock. Additionally, the plug fuse does not confirm to the requirements of BS 1362. The fuse is required to ensure the safe operation of the plug under fault conditions, and a non-conforming fuse could lead to the plug overheating and/or exploding. Improvements are also required to product documentation and marking.</p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of the Electrical Equipment (Safety) Regulations 2016 or the Plugs and Sockets etc. (Safety) Regulations 1994.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The import has been rejected at the border.</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2511-0314</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2025-12-23T15:27:01Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-safety-report","product_category":"electrical-appliances-equipment","product_measure_type":["import-rejected-at-border"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2025-12-23","product_risk_level":"high"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2025-12-23T15:27:01+00:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-counterfeit-dyson-supersonic-hairdryer-2511-0314","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-counterfeit-dyson-supersonic-hairdryer-2511-0314","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-counterfeit-dyson-supersonic-hairdryer-2511-0314","content_id":"54a0c4d9-f202-47e9-a8d3-782e05de99ab","document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2025-12-23T15:27:01Z","schema_name":"specialist_document","title":"Product Safety Report: Counterfeit Dyson Supersonic Hairdryer (2511-0314)","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-counterfeit-dyson-supersonic-hairdryer-2511-0314","withdrawn":false}],"finder":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","content_id":"a22b3f1f-2c91-49a1-a469-ff21d465c543","details":{"facets":[{"allowed_values":[{"label":"Product safety alert","value":"product-safety-alert"},{"label":"Product safety report","value":"product-safety-report"},{"label":"Product recall","value":"product-recall"}],"display_as_result_metadata":true,"filterable":true,"key":"product_alert_type","name":"Alert type","preposition":"of type","short_name":"Alert type","type":"text"},{"allowed_values":[{"label":"Serious","value":"serious"},{"label":"High","value":"high"},{"label":"Medium","value":"medium"},{"label":"Low","value":"low"},{"label":"Not p